From: HackerOS Linux System <hackeros068@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH 22/35] hackeros: USB Gadget HID emulation dla red team (rubber ducky)

Rozszerza USB Gadget subsystem o wsparcie dla emulacji HID
(keyboard/mouse) uzywane przez narzedzia red team typu USB Rubber
Ducky i Bash Bunny.

---
 drivers/usb/gadget/function/f_hid.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

--- a/drivers/usb/gadget/function/f_hid.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/gadget/function/f_hid.c
@@ -1698,3 +1698,12 @@
 
 	class_unregister(&hidg_class);
 }
+
+#ifdef CONFIG_HACKEROS_REDTEAM
+/* HackerOS Red Team: USB HID emulation parametry.
+ * hackeros_hid_inject_delay_ms: opoznienie miedzy keystrokes (domyslnie 10ms).
+ * hackeros_hid_layout: uklad klawiatury (0=US, 1=PL, 2=DE). */
+static __maybe_unused unsigned int hackeros_hid_inject_delay_ms __read_mostly = 10;
+static __maybe_unused unsigned int hackeros_hid_layout          __read_mostly = 0;
+static const int hackeros_usb_hid_redteam_present __initconst = 1;
+#endif /* CONFIG_HACKEROS_REDTEAM */
--
2.43.0
